same acceptance would be refused rather than applied.\n\n**Worker frame result.** Indeterminate, with the work-result variant `incomplete`. The Worker may not return candidate ready without the verification evidence, and refused does not apply because effects were attempted. Recorded progress remains valid: the prechecks, the accepted plan and the preimages it presented.\n\n**Reviewer frame result.** Falsified for the claim as stated. Finding one: completion is asserted without the required verification of the definition and one native binding. Finding two: automatic retry is asserted against a hold and against the acceptance rule. Triage is complete on the rule violation and indeterminate on actual effect state, cause and blast radius. Severity is evidence-bound: a retry without recovery could apply against changed preimages. Priority and disposition remain with Executive.\n\n**Residual judgment and owner authority.** Whether the observation gap is temporary or permanent is J. Whether read-only observation and preimage recovery fall inside the existing grant's isolated write territory is not stipulated; I assess observation as within it, and recovery as unresolved. The original grant and plan acceptance remain O in their original scope, neither established nor revoked. Any retry is a new acceptance of a rederived plan, owned by the same owner.\n\n**Permitted next work.** Report the Worker result as incomplete with the observation gap, attempted subject and valid progress. Then obtain actual effect evidence within the isolated territory before choosing any path. If every target verifies, completion follows. If a failure or partial state is found, or observation stays impossible, recover from the presented preimages before any complete claim. Return to the owner only if recovery authority or the acceptance is materially changed or newly ambiguous. No automatic retry is supported in any branch. Nothing here authorizes live consumer or fleet effects.\n\n**Invalidators.